:::


#### Age

@fig-vote_derniers_elections-age compares changes in voting behaviour between age groups. Among the 18 to 20 year-olds, the share of volunteers who have changed towards "Yes" was highest. One interpretation could be, that the service civique might encourage this age group in particular to vote. However, an alternative explanation could be that this group could vote for the first time during their service civique, as the legal voting age in France is 18. 


