There are 14 different programs, which can be sorted into 6 different categories (see [Tables](tables.qmd)). Here, we only distinguish between 7 key program categories, namely: Solidarité Séniors; Médiaterre; Cinéma & Citoyenneté; Solidarité Aidants; Booster; Ecovolonterre; ASM. @fig-programs-overview provides an overview of the number of volunteers in the different key programs, across promotions. Note that not all key programs appear in all cohorts in the data: "Solidarité Séniors" and "Solidarité Aidants" only appear from the 2021-22 cohort onwards, and "ASM" only from the 2022-23 cohort onwards.

